# The build of the Dockerfile needs only the Go module, its sources, the shared packages of pkg/
# and the sources of request-cert, token-setup, request-token and simple-ca-wif, the embedded
# assets and page templates, the help serve shows at /help/ and the guides serve --docs shows at
# /docs/.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
!pkg
!cmd/request-cert
!cmd/token-setup
!cmd/request-token
!cmd/simple-ca-wif
!assets
!templates
!help
!docs/*.md
!docs/workload-identity/*.md
